+Experimental r49 source recipe: r47 DMP series plus video flush-before-enable.
+All five patches reproduce the ten modified source files; six local SHA-512
+checks and shell syntax pass. This recipe is not yet built as an Alpine source
+APK. The installed binary-wrapper APK retains the r47 kernel and uses a properly
+in-tree-built, signed replacement MSM module. Startup and three RTC controls
+show zero underruns and taint zero, with recovered sensor streams. Twenty consecutive physical DMP wakes plus a matched masked-motion control
+pass; owner confirms display and touch. Battery/longer-load, overall 50-cycle
+and wider MDP5 qualification remain open. r48 external-module build is retired for out-of-tree taint. No audio tests.
